{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節有三姐蕭秀香教大家做「水瓜半煎煮魚雲」。鮮美嫩滑的魚雲結合清甜的水瓜與惹味的鹹豬肉、潮州豆醬，層次豐富，風味十足，大家快來試做吧！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>材料：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大魚頭 1個</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水瓜 2條</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹹豬肉 2両切粒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芹菜 1條</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">白雲耳 適量（浸軟汆水）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅辣椒 2粒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">薑 4片（拍碎）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉 適量</p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>調味：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃砂糖 1茶匙</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">胡椒粉 適量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">白酒 2湯匙</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">潮州豆醬 1湯匙</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽 適量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">生粉 適量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豉油 適量</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b678a4e4-0eae-4c21-a896-417e5ce32ba2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265cKAOoLBDF1784777158.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b678a4e4-0eae-4c21-a896-417e5ce32ba2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T01:10:49.016960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}